      "sentence": "QZSS L1S DCX/CAMF and QZQSM decoder for Arduino",
      "paragraph": "Decodes QZSS L1S disaster alert messages from UBX (RXM-SFRBX) or NMEA ($QZQSM). All 12 JMA DC Report sub-types supported. Definition tables auto-generated from azarashi. No heap allocation. No external dependencies. Corresponds to IS-QZSS-DCR-017 (MT=43, all 12 categories), IS-QZSS-DCX-004 Rev.004 and EWSS-CAMF v1.2 (MT=44). Definition tables are auto-generated from azarashi 0.17.1.",
